WEBVTT

00:05.480 --> 00:08.200
Archers follow my orders.

00:10.880 --> 00:12.280
Fire arrows.

00:17.040 --> 00:18.440
Fire arrows.

00:22.880 --> 00:24.280
No!

00:30.080 --> 00:35.000
Faster move forward faster, no retreat, retreat and die.

00:39.120 --> 00:40.720
Archers, ready.

00:47.600 --> 00:53.120
The northern expedition may one day succeed but they will never see it.

00:53.680 --> 00:58.400
The stench of blood rises beneath the walls you feel your throat tighten Your stomach churns.

00:58.480 --> 01:03.320
But you remain standing on the city walls you know for the rest of your life.

01:03.400 --> 01:08.080
You will never forget this day when we finally defeat the Wuzhao.

01:08.240 --> 01:10.200
You will repay them a hundredfold.

01:11.560 --> 01:12.960
Fire arrows.

01:47.400 --> 01:49.000
Fire arrows.

01:50.500 --> 01:59.000
Wu Junren drove waves of displaced refugees against the city walls for three days straight. The defending troops atop the walls showed no mercy, and the corpses of the refugees mingled with dirt and stones, piling into a marsh of flesh and blood beneath the city walls...

